%% Intrak V2 - Attendance Logging Sequence Diagram
%% Paste this into: https://mermaid.live/

sequenceDiagram
    participant Student
    participant Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant AttService as Attendance Service
    participant QRService as QR Service
    participant GPS as GPS Verification
    participant Database as PostgreSQL
    
    Note over Student,Database: Attendance Logging Flow (QR Method)
    
    Student->>Frontend: 1. Request QR Code
    Frontend->>API: 2. GET /api/attendance/qr-token
    API->>Auth: 3. Verify JWT Token
    Auth-->>API: 4. Token Valid
    
    API->>QRService: 5. Generate QR Token
    QRService->>Database: 6. Save QR Token<br/>(expires in 5 min)
    Database-->>QRService: 7. Token Created
    QRService-->>API: 8. QR Token
    API-->>Frontend: 9. QR Token Data
    Frontend-->>Student: 10. Display QR Code
    
    Note over Student,Database: Student Scans QR Code
    
    Student->>Frontend: 11. Scan QR Code<br/>(at company location)
    Frontend->>API: 12. POST /api/attendance/qr-verify<br/>(token + location)
    
    API->>Auth: 13. Verify JWT Token
    Auth-->>API: 14. Token Valid
    
    API->>QRService: 15. Validate QR Token
    QRService->>Database: 16. Check Token<br/>(exists, not expired, not used)
    Database-->>QRService: 17. Token Valid
    
    QRService->>GPS: 18. Verify Location<br/>(if GPS enabled)
    GPS-->>QRService: 19. Location Verified
    
    QRService->>AttService: 20. Create Attendance Log
    AttService->>Database: 21. Create Attendance Record<br/>(timeIn, verified: true)
    Database-->>AttService: 22. Record Created
    
    AttService->>Database: 23. Update Student<br/>completedHours
    Database-->>AttService: 24. Updated
    
    AttService->>Database: 25. Mark QR Token as Used
    Database-->>AttService: 26. Token Updated
    
    AttService-->>API: 27. Attendance Logged
    API-->>Frontend: 28. Success Response
    Frontend-->>Student: 29. Show Success<br/>"Attendance Logged"
    
    Note over Student,Database: Time Out Process
    
    Student->>Frontend: 30. Log Time Out
    Frontend->>API: 31. PUT /api/attendance/:id/timeout
    API->>Auth: 32. Verify Token
    Auth-->>API: 33. Authorized
    API->>AttService: 34. Update Attendance Log
    AttService->>Database: 35. Update timeOut<br/>Calculate duration
    Database-->>AttService: 36. Updated
    AttService-->>API: 37. Success
    API-->>Frontend: 38. Success Response
    Frontend-->>Student: 39. Time Out Logged


